#. translators: For example: "home-manager: missing argument for --cores"
#: home-manager/home-manager:16
msgid "%s: missing argument for %s"
msgstr "%s: manglar eitt ávirki fyri %s"

#. translators: For example: "home-manager: --rollback can only be used after switch"
#: home-manager/home-manager:22
msgid "%s: %s can only be used after %s"
msgstr "%s: %s kann bert brúkast aftaná %s"

#: home-manager/home-manager:71
msgid "No configuration file found at %s"
msgstr "Eingin samansetingsfíla funni hjá %s"

#. translators: The first '%s' specifier will be replaced by either
#. 'home.nix' or 'flake.nix'.
#: home-manager/home-manager:88 home-manager/home-manager:92
#: home-manager/home-manager:191
msgid ""
"Keeping your Home Manager %s in %s is deprecated,\n"
"please move it to %s"
msgstr ""
"At hava Heimvørðurin %s í %s er fyrnast,\n"
"vinarliga flyt hann til %s"

#: home-manager/home-manager:99
msgid "No configuration file found. Please create one at %s"
msgstr "Eingin samansetingsfíla funni. Vinarliga stovna ein hjá %s"

#: home-manager/home-manager:114
msgid "Home Manager not found at %s."
msgstr "Home Manager ikki funnið á %s."

#. translators: This message will be seen by very few users that likely are familiar with English. So feel free to leave this untranslated.
#: home-manager/home-manager:122
msgid ""
"The fallback Home Manager path %s has been deprecated and a file/directory "
"was found there."
msgstr ""
"Fallback-vegin hjá Home Manager %s er farin úr gildi, og ein fíla/ein mappa "
"var funnin har."

#. translators: This message will be seen by very few users that likely are familiar with English. So feel free to leave this untranslated.
#: home-manager/home-manager:125
msgid ""
"To remove this warning, do one of the following.\n"
"\n"
"1. Explicitly tell Home Manager to use the path, for example by adding\n"
"\n"
"     { programs.home-manager.path = \"%s\"; }\n"
"\n"
"   to your configuration.\n"
"\n"
"   If you import Home Manager directly, you can use the `path` parameter\n"
"\n"
"     pkgs.callPackage /path/to/home-manager-package { path = \"%s\"; }\n"
"\n"
"   when calling the Home Manager package.\n"
"\n"
"2. Remove the deprecated path.\n"
"\n"
"     $ rm -r \"%s\""
msgstr ""
"Fyri at taka hesa ávaringina burt, ger eitt av hesum.\n"
"\n"
"1.Greið Home Manager beinleiðis frá, at stígurin skal brúkast, til dømis við "
"at leggja hetta afturat\n"
"\n"
"    { programs.home-manager.path = \"%s\"; }\n"
"\n"
"    í uppsetningina hjá tær.\n"
"\n"
"    Um tú importar Home Manager beinleiðis, kanst tú brúka path-parametrið\n"
"\n"
"    pkgs.callPackage /path/to/home-manager-package { path = \"%s\"; }\n"
"\n"
"    tá tú kallar á Home Manager-pakkan.\n"
" \n"
"2.Tak burtur tann foraldraða stígin.\n"
"\n"
"    $ rm -r \"%s\""

#: home-manager/home-manager:153
msgid "Sanity checking Nix"
msgstr "Skynsemiskontroll av Nix"

#: home-manager/home-manager:173
msgid "Could not find suitable profile directory, tried %s and %s"
msgstr "Kundi ikki finna hóskandi profil-mappu, royndi %s og %s"

#. translators: Here "flake" is a noun that refers to the Nix Flakes feature.
#: home-manager/home-manager:230
msgid "Can't inspect options of a flake configuration"
msgstr "Kann ikki granska valmøguleikar í eini flake-uppsetning"

#: home-manager/home-manager:340 home-manager/home-manager:363
#: home-manager/home-manager:769 home-manager/home-manager:1289
msgid "%s: unknown option '%s'"
msgstr "%s: ókendur kostur '%s'"

#: home-manager/home-manager:345 home-manager/home-manager:1290
msgid "Run '%s --help' for usage help"
msgstr "Koyr '%s --help' fyri at fáa hjálp við nýtslu"

#: home-manager/home-manager:371 home-manager/home-manager:476
msgid "The file %s already exists, leaving it unchanged..."
msgstr "Fílan %s er longu til, verður látin óbroytt..."

#: home-manager/home-manager:373 home-manager/home-manager:478
msgid "Creating %s..."
msgstr "Ger %s... / Skapar %s..."

#: home-manager/home-manager:522
msgid "Creating initial Home Manager generation..."
msgstr "Skapar fyrstu Home Manager-generasjón..."

#. translators: The "%s" specifier will be replaced by a file path.
#: home-manager/home-manager:527
msgid ""
"All done! The home-manager tool should now be installed and you can edit\n"
"\n"
"    %s\n"
"\n"
"to configure Home Manager. Run 'man home-configuration.nix' to\n"
"see all available options."
msgstr ""
"Alt klárt! home-manager-verktoyið eigur nú at vera lagt inn, og tú kanst "
"rætta\n"
"\n"
"    %s\n"
"\n"
"fyri at seta Home Manager upp. Koyr 'man home-configuration.nix' fyri at \n"
"síggja allar tøkar valmøguleikar."

#. translators: The "%s" specifier will be replaced by a URL.
#: home-manager/home-manager:532
msgid ""
"Uh oh, the installation failed! Please create an issue at\n"
"\n"
"    %s\n"
"\n"
"if the error seems to be the fault of Home Manager."
msgstr ""
"Áh, innleggingin miseydnaðist! Vinarliga stovna eitt issue á\n"
"\n"
"    %s\n"
"\n"
"um mistøkurin tykist vera ein feilur í Home Manager."

#. translators: Here "flake" is a noun that refers to the Nix Flakes feature.
#: home-manager/home-manager:543
msgid "Can't instantiate a flake configuration"
msgstr "Kann ikki seta eina flake-uppsetning í verk"

#: home-manager/home-manager:619
msgid ""
"There is %d unread and relevant news item.\n"
"Read it by running the command \"%s news\"."
msgid_plural ""
"There are %d unread and relevant news items.\n"
"Read them by running the command \"%s news\"."
msgstr[0] ""
"Tað er %d ólesin og viðkomandi tíðindi.\n"
"Les tað við at koyra kommanduna \"%s news\"."
msgstr[1] ""
"Tað eru %d ólesin og viðkomandi tíðindi.\n"
"Les tey við at koyra kommanduna \"%s news\"."

#: home-manager/home-manager:633
msgid "Unknown \"news.display\" setting \"%s\"."
msgstr "Ókend innstilling \"%s\" fyri \"news.display\"."

#: home-manager/home-manager:641
#, sh-format
msgid "Please set the $EDITOR or $VISUAL environment variable"
msgstr "Vinarliga set umhvarvsbroytið EDITORellaEDITORellaVISUAL"

#: home-manager/home-manager:659
msgid "Cannot run build in read-only directory"
msgstr "Kann ikki byggja í eini skrivverndari mappu"

#: home-manager/home-manager:822
msgid "The configuration does not contain the specialisation \"%s\""
msgstr "Uppsetningin inniheldur ikki serstakningin \"%s\""

#: home-manager/home-manager:876
msgid "No generation with ID %s"
msgstr "Ongin generasjón við ID %s"

#: home-manager/home-manager:878
msgid "Cannot remove the current generation %s"
msgstr "Kann ikki taka burt verandi generasjón %s"

#: home-manager/home-manager:880
msgid "Removing generation %s"
msgstr "Tak burt generasjón %s"

#: home-manager/home-manager:901
msgid "No generations to expire"
msgstr "Ongar generasjónir att eru at taka burt"

#: home-manager/home-manager:912
msgid "No home-manager packages seem to be installed."
msgstr "Tað sær ikki út til, at nakrar home-manager-pakkar eru lagdir inn."

#: home-manager/home-manager:997
msgid "Unknown argument %s"
msgstr "Ókent argument %s"

#: home-manager/home-manager:1022
msgid "This will remove Home Manager from your system."
msgstr "Hetta tekur Home Manager burt úr skipanini hjá tær."

#: home-manager/home-manager:1025
msgid "This is a dry run, nothing will actually be uninstalled."
msgstr "Hetta er ein turrroynd, einki verður í roynd og veru avinstallerað."

#: home-manager/home-manager:1029
msgid "Really uninstall Home Manager?"
msgstr "Vilt tú veruliga avinstallera Home Manager?"

#: home-manager/home-manager:1035
msgid "Switching to empty Home Manager configuration..."
msgstr "Skifti til eina tóma Home Manager-uppsetning..."

#: home-manager/home-manager:1050
msgid "Yay!"
msgstr "Jáj!"

#: home-manager/home-manager:1055
msgid "Home Manager is uninstalled but your home.nix is left untouched."
msgstr "Home Manager er avinstallerað, men home.nix hjá tær er latt óbroytt."

#: home-manager/home-manager:1334
msgid "expire-generations expects one argument, got %d."
msgstr "expire-generations væntar eini argument, fekk %d."

#: home-manager/home-manager:1359
msgid "Unknown command: %s"
msgstr "Ókend kommando: %s"

#: home-manager/install.nix:21
msgid "This derivation is not buildable, please run it using nix-shell."
msgstr "Henda derivation er ikki byggjanleg, vinarliga koyr hana við nix-shell."
